  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Those who have opened the aperture, using their own primeval essence to feed, refine, and manipulate Gu, are called Gu Masters. Fresh from the Awakening Ceremony, with the primeval sea coagulated, they sit at rank one. Gu Masters have nine ranks from rank one to rank nine. Every rank is a great realm with four small realms: initial stage, middle stage, upper stage, and peak stage.",
      "chapters": [
        7
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_awakening_ceremony"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From the general aspect, ranks one to five are mortal, while six to nine are immortal. Among ten million Gu Masters, not even one might become an immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters at rank one to rank five all suffer the restraints of primeval essence. Only after going beyond mortal and becoming a Gu Immortal do they gain endless primeval essence.",
      "chapters": [
        341
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the five mortal ranks, rank one and two are beginners, and rank four to five are a high level fighting force. Gu Masters at rank three sit in the middle and connect the two. By rank three a Gu Master is already full-fledged, and that stage is where foundations and the direction of advance are set.",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mortal-five-ranks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cultivators at rank six and above are covered on Gu Immortal. The full ladder is covered on ranks and realms.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mortal-five-ranks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
